and none of their bytes are reproduced here.

| File | Subject | Author | What is recorded |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `research/cve_patchsignal_reverse.md` | `patchsignal-v18c` (CVE_LOOKUP) | `0x236891fe`, no licence published | its feature model and its black-box response, recovered from the binary its owner supplied to us and asked us to analyse |
| `research/agent_task/champ-scores.json`, `bench/champ-real-scores.json`, `bench/champion-corpus-scores.json` | the Telegraph baseline module | MIT © 2026 telegraphprotocol | scores it produced on inputs we wrote |

Those score files are numbers a public module returned for questions we authored. They
